description:
Indian Compass is a mobile app featuring sacred Indian scripture, meditation materials, and content for reflection and spiritual awareness.

The app includes the Bhagavad Gita: 18 chapters and 701 verses, with the original text, transliteration, and translation.

For personalization, you can enter your date and place of birth, as well as your current city and country. This information is used within the app to organize and present meditation and spiritual reflection content based on traditional Indian texts and systems.

Indian Compass is designed as a tool for reading, reflection, and exploring the ancient Indian spiritual tradition.

Main features:

• Bhagavad Gita texts;
• original text, transliteration, and translation;
• personalized sections based on the information you provide;
• materials for meditation and self-reflection;
• simple and clear interface;
• use without a constant internet connection.

All main calculations are performed directly on the device. Information entered by the user is processed locally, and the main text materials are stored within the app and remain available without an internet connection.

No user account is required to access the main features.

Flotta STEM è l'app dei dipendenti di STEM S.r.l. per sbloccare i furgoni aziendali col telefono, al posto del badge.

Come funziona:
• entri con la tua email e un codice che arriva per email, senza password;
• registri il telefono: la sua chiave di sicurezza nasce nel chip del telefono e non ne esce mai;
• l'ufficio approva il telefono;
• sul mezzo premi «Sblocca», appoggi il telefono al bollino sul cruscotto, confermi con Face ID e giri la chiave.

Lo sblocco funziona anche senza campo: lo decide la scatola montata sul mezzo, in Bluetooth.

Nell'app vedi anche i tuoi viaggi e i mezzi che puoi guidare.

L'accesso è riservato ai dipendenti di STEM: i telefoni li approva l'ufficio.

Informativa sul trattamento dei dati: https://flotta.stemhtservice.com/t/informativa

Members is the member-area app for people who study with schools and creators that use TokeWoot. Sign in with the access your school gave you and pick up your courses where you left off.

Each area shows up with the identity of whoever created it: name, logo, colors, cover and language. If you study with more than one school, add them all and switch areas from your profile.

In the app you can:
• see the courses you are enrolled in and your progress in each one;
• resume your last lesson with one tap;
• watch video lessons in the player of whoever hosts the content;
• watch full screen, with your phone sideways;
• mark lessons as complete and move on to the next one;
• answer quizzes and rate lessons;
• leave comments and questions for the school, and report or block what does not belong;
• open each lesson's files;
• get your certificate when the course offers one.

How to sign in
1. Open the app and paste the link to your member area (the address your school sent you).
2. Sign in with your WhatsApp number, email or username and your password.
3. First time? Tap "First access" to create your password.

Access is granted by the school when you enroll. The app does not sell courses: it shows what you already have. Lessons need an internet connection.

Questions about content, enrollment or access? Use your area's support button to reach the school.

Приложение лингвистического центра Priorita для родителей и учеников.

Для родителей:
• чат с администратором филиала — вопросы, переносы занятий, документы;
• чаты с педагогами вашего ребёнка;
• расписание занятий и домашние задания;
• история оплат, бонусы, информация о педагоге;
• уведомления о новых сообщениях;
• онлайн-уроки Priorita class прямо в приложении;
• код для входа ребёнка в его собственный режим.

Для учеников:
• задания и игры по своему учебнику;
• слова юнита с озвучкой;
• ближайшие уроки и вход в онлайн-урок;
• чаты группы с учителем.

Приложением пользуются семьи, которые занимаются в лингвистическом центре Priorita. Вход — по номеру телефона, указанному в договоре.
